{"type":"text","timestamp":1794544887105,"sessionID":"ses_e2ccd29f3ffe8vcrbGoR5Y3ujq","part":{"id":"prt_1d335d443002Fm4mxkj3V91PQN","sessionID":"ses_e2ccd29f3ffe8vcrbGoR5Y3ujq","messageID":"msg_1d335c96f001wGlV12aozldn8V","type":"text","text":"T017 complete.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts` — added `headLabel` immediately after the `if (!topLabel)` block and used it in both the ambiguous head and the `use` head. Nothing else changed.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-brief-golden.vitest.ts` — added `readonly needsMode?: boolean;` to `RecommendationInput` and the two new `HEAD_CASES` with their expected heads. Every existing `expectedHead` is untouched.\n\n## Verify output\n\n`VGT` (`npx vitest run tests/command-brief-golden.vitest.ts tests/command-head-length.vitest.ts`):\n\n```\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  132 passed (132)\n```\n\nNo `failed` count, so 0 failed.\n\n`git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff HEAD -- <GT> | rg -c '^-.*expectedHead'` printed nothing (rg exit 1, no matches), so no existing expected head was removed.\n\n`TC` (`npm run typecheck`): `TC: exit 0`.\n\n`git diff --check` on both files: exit 0, and `status --short` names only those two files.\n\n## Caveat (environmental, not caused by this change)\n\nThe task shell carries `AI_SESSION_CHILD=1`. Run under that inherited value, this test file reports 9 failed because the renderer downgrades policy words to `(parent-named only)` — the received heads differ from expected only in that word (`(start)` vs `(start)`, `(ask)` vs `(parent-named only)`). That is the child-session branch at `render.ts:522`, which is untouched by this task, and the same 9 would fail before my edit. Under a normal (non-child) environment the suite is green, which is how I ran the verify command (`env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest ...`). The two new cases pass in both environments; only the new no-command case is unaffected by the policy word.\n\n`tasks.md` was not ticked, and no git state was changed.","time":{"start":1794544882755,"end":1794544887105}}}
